        "FireRed, LeafGreen, English or European Emerald: MYSTERY GIFT > WONDER CARDS > WIRELESS COMMUNICATION.",
        "Japanese Emerald: ふしぎな おくりもの (fushigi na okurimono) > ふしぎな カード (fushigi na kaado)",
        "  > じゅしん スポット (jushin supotto) > よみこむ (yomikomu), then B back to the title menu.",
        "  The title menu says ふしぎな おくりもの only when the game finds the adapter. If it says",
        "  ふしぎな もらいもの (fushigi na moraimono), the game was switched on too early: switch it off and on again.",
        "No MYSTERY GIFT on the title menu? Enter LINK TOGETHER WITH ALL at the Poke Mart questionnaire,",
